 ance to live like a celebrity for the afternoon. Hosted by B-day Queen Jay
 jay Kings (Family Feud Canada\, Drag Brunch Saved My Life)\, Toronto&#x27\
 ;s Latin Sensation Dahlia Doll (Family Feud Canada\, Call Me Mother!) and 
 future fame monster Paris Matik (Drag Brunch Saved My Life)! Each ticket i
 ncludes one bingo card Additional bingo cards are sold for via cash\, card
  or e-transfer: 1 for $10 3 for $15 4 for $25 Each additonal bingo card co
 mes with a raffle ticket to win the large prize. 📍 Agave Azul 745 Queen
  St. West\, Toronto Saturday\, Oct 17th Doors Open: 12:00 PM Bingo &amp\; 
 Show Begin: 1:00 PM Whether you’re a longtime drag fan\, a pop music obs
 essive\, a bingo babe\, or simply looking for a ridiculously fun Saturday 
 brunch… the FAME GAME is waiting. ‍
