BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Big Vinyl Record Swap
DTSTART:20261017T150000
DTEND:20261017T150000
UID:e5541b1300d9212155989e1e76b1f01a@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:If you have 5 records or 50 records to trade - this event is f
 or you! FREE to attend\, but you might want to &#x27\;rent&#x27\; a table.
  By popular demand we are adding a VINYL SWAP On the same day as our MEGA 
 BOOK SWAP Info here: MEGA BOOK SWAP This runs differently than the book sw
 ap. #1 It only runs 3pm-6pm #2 (Almost) All swapping is between people How
  it works: If you have 20 or more records to swap\, we recommend you &#x27
 \;rent&#x27\; a 3 foot table. This would fit at least 2 crates of records.
  That way people come to you\, look through your collection\, and try to m
 ake trades. &#x27\;Renting&#x27\; a table is $6-$10 an hour. If you have l
 ess than 20 records to swap\, you can walk around and visit the tables or 
 use the &#x27\;communal&#x27\; table to make trades. If you want to leave/
 donate any records\, they will be added to the &#x27\;donation pool&#x27\;
  and people can buy them for $5\, with all money going to support Glad Day
  Lit&#x27\;s non-profit work. TO RENT A TABLE Choose the time you want to 
 ‘rent’ the table by buying the time slot here on Eventbrite. There are
  TWO CHOICES of table: A) A three foot table that fits 2 milk crates of re
 cords easily. You can rent this for one\, two or three hours at $6 an hour
 . B) An extra wide four foot table that fits 6 milk crates of records on i
 t easily. This you rent for the whole 3 hours for $30\, with extra time fo
 r set-up and take-down. A note on ‘swapping’: This is really meant to 
 be a SWAP not a market. Records should not be priced\, but if people end u
 p haggling and negotiating deals with each other\, (like “I will trade y
 ou these 5 records and $20 for that one record”) we are not going to car
 e. Accessibility The entrance\, space and washrooms are wheelchair accessi
 ble. Do NOT wear strong scents like cologne\, body spray or perfume. ‍
LOCATION:Glad Day (32 Lisgar)\, 32 Lisgar
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/big-vinyl-record-swap
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
