 egular spots such as Sunday Social \,Little Jerrys\, 915 DuPont and festiv
 als such as Boreal and HarvestFestival. During this time\, Ali has also ma
 naged Nitebeat Radio - a platform that helps to foster and showcase Toront
 o’s musical talent. Supported by Toronto local favourite Kiki LeFreak Ti
