BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[Redacted]: Gotham ft Naija Couture (NYC)
DTSTART:20261017T230000
DTEND:20261017T230000
UID:089e2766cb6e789eae3e9783cb6c094c@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:[Redacted] presents “Gotham”\, a party exploring urban dec
 ay\, concrete jungles and upward trajectories to nowhere. DJs: Upstairs: N
 aija Couture (NYC)\, Moody Jooly\, BlkVirgo\, Widdows95 Downstairs (chill 
 room): Kerub\, Widdows95 Naija Couture is a Brooklyn-based DJ\, writer\, a
 rtist\, and shapeshifter. Texas-born and raised in Georgia\, Naija Couture
 ’s experience growing up with VH1\, MTV and The RuPaul Show created a fo
 undation of understanding what dance music can still look like in the age 
 of the internet. Naija found their musical niche through EDM and queer-cen
 tered campouts in the early 2010’s Southern US. Textures and vocals of a
 ll kinds find their ways into his sets- ones that often move between circu
 it and cunt\, contemporary vogue and deep house\, electro and trip hop. Fl
 yer Art: Binadra (Warsaw) Door staff: V __________________________________
 _______ [Redacted] exists as an open\, carefree space for punks\, ravers\,
  queers\, and allies - featuring carefully curated lineups of local and in
 ternational DJs. Entry at the door is $25\, so we encourage purchasing tic
 kets in advance online. Our first 15 tickets are always $15. _____________
 ___________________ PLUR. Discrimination or harassment towards others base
 d on protected characteristics will not be tolerated. Tell one of the staf
 f if you are made to feel uncomfortable - this is an enforced safe space. 
 Please do not take photos of others without their permission. NEW VENUE - 
