 s\, scooter\, with a walker or folks who cannot do more than 2 stairs) Whi
 le our front door and the inside of the space is accessible\, some environ
 mental factors (like snow) can impact the path to the front door through t
 he park. So here is the accessible alternative: You can access our front d
 oor by going through the condo next door. OPTION #1: 21 Abell St - Get dro
 pped off or picked up at 21 Abell and enter the condo from the east side. 
