  / 16 Lisgar. Enter the condo from the south side\, which is a covered dri
 veway behind the condo. You enter from the south\, you walk through the lo
 bby and then out the north (main) door\, you are then at Glad Day. This on
 e can be tricky so the 21 Abell option is often more reliable. ‍
