SUMMARY:TOKiMONSTA and Vjollça
DTSTART:20261022T220000
DTEND:20261022T220000
UID:a3a5cb42462980eae28faf7692c29a42@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:TOKIMONSTA and Vjollça at Standard Time! GRAMMY-nominated pro
 ducer TOKiMONSTA (Jennifer Lee) has charted a fascinating career over the 
 past 10+ years. She is one of the most revered music producers as one of t
 he pioneers of the seminal 2010 era “L.A. Beat Scene.” Known for her g
 enre-blending sound and innovative production\, her seventh album\, Eterna
 l Reverie\, explores themes of resilience and joy\, capturing the transfor
 mative power of music. After overcoming personal challenges\, including a 
 life-threatening brain condition\, she continues to push creative boundari
 es\, blending influences from global cultures. With a career marked by fea
 rless experimentation\, TOKiMONSTA remains a dynamic force in electronic m
 usic\, inspiring and transporting listeners. Join us on a Thursday evening
  as Vjollça starts things off at 9pm. ‍
LOCATION:Standard Time\, 165 Geary Avenue #2nd Floor Unit A
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/tokimonsta-and-vjollca
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
