SUMMARY:Eternal Winter: VINTAGE SAPPHIC SALON
DTSTART:20261024T183000
DTEND:20261024T183000
UID:03d37c77a20f8e042543d6a03b46e7e5@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Step into Eternal Winter\, a cozy vintage sapphic salon where 
 stories\, style\, and poetry melt the frost away. Eternal Winter: VINTAGE 
 SAPPHIC SALON Date &amp\; Time: Saturday\, October 24\, 2026 | Doors Open 
 at 6:30 PM | Performance at 7:00 PM | Q&amp\;A at 8 PM | Mingling ‘till 
 9 PM Venue: The Green Room at Book Bar About this Event: Join émigré aut
 hor and scholar Veronika Sizova for an exclusive\, intimate evening of her
  sapphic prose + poetry performance within the curated\, vintage atmospher
 e of The Green Room. The evening will feature a live reading of passages f
 rom her sapphic romance novel «The Dawn of Eternal Winter» (Life Rattle 
 Press)\, exploring the intricate boundaries of lesbian desire in Saint Pet
 ersburg\, 1905. Guests will be treated to 2 complimentary signature cockta
 ils crafted specifically for this night alongside light hors d&#x27\;oeuvr
 es. Following the performance and a Q&amp\;A session\, a private signing a
 nd social mingling with other sapphics will take place. Dress-up is encour
 aged! Tickets Tier 1: General Admission — $25.00 CAD What is included: E
 ntry to the private reading session at The Green Room\, 2 drinks\, and lig
 ht gourmet appetizers. Tier 2: VIP Author’s Experience (Admission + Book
 ) — $40.00 CAD What is included: All benefits of Tier 1\, plus a guarant
 eed\, personally signed and dedicated copy of the debut novel «The Dawn o
 f Eternal Winter» Please note: This event is 21+\, wlw-only. Capacity is 
 limited to preserve the tight\, close-knit experience of the performance. 
 Early booking is highly recommended. ‍
LOCATION:600 Markham St\, 600 Markham St
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/eternal-winter-vintage-sapphic-salon
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
