BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Community Ties: Our Future Together
DTSTART:20261025T140000
DTEND:20261025T140000
UID:8a693f345e051b02dce5f1db2e71d8da@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Help Shape the Future of The ArQuives The ArQuives: Canada’s
  2SLGBTQIA+ Archives is entering an exciting new chapter. Through Communit
 y Ties: Our Future Together\, we invite you to help shape what comes next.
  This is a pivotal moment for 2SLGBTQIA+ communities across Canada. As cha
 llenges to queer and trans rights grow both globally and locally\, it’s 
 more important than ever to protect\, celebrate\, and share our stories. T
 he ArQuives has served 2SLGBTQIA+ communities across Canada since 1973\, a
 nd is now reimagining how it can continue and strengthen that work over th
 e next 50 years. With funding from Women and Gender Equality Canada\, we a
 re continuing this national conversation to better understand how The ArQu
 ives can grow its impact and remain responsive to the diverse communities 
 it supports. ‍
LOCATION:The ArQuives\, 34 Isabella Street
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/community-ties-our-future-together
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
