UID:5dd235b354372bb898716c7a15f0e5f2@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:TORONTO\, we are back again with DJs\, drag\, costumes and thi
 s time\, with the icon DRUSILLA! Drusilla is back in Sunnydale and is read
 y to BITE! Join us at The Bronze\, October 30th\, for an incredible Buffy 
 themed dance party\, hosted by Juliet Landau herself! DJs Teesh &amp\; Sop
 hie Jones will be spinning all night to keep you dancing with hosts Leelan
 do\, Red Farrow\, Josh Kirby\, Leon Blackwood\, Trishelle Esposito\, Tiber
 \, Bella Bimbo\, Gorgina &amp\; Kasper The Queer Ghost! Special performanc
