DESCRIPTION:☣ Toronto cyberpunks &amp\; rivetheads assemble! There was a
  major radioactive spill in the biohazard basement\, there are sick and tw
 isted demented monsters spawning all over and they want to PARTY. DAS MORT
 UARY presents: DYSTOPIAN HALLOWEEN! The containment doors have failed and 
 the hoarde is storming the basement. Zombies are dragging themselves onto 
 the dance floor\, arms outstretched for the bass. Plague doctors are handi
 ng out pills of god knows what. Judge Dredd is at the door and for once he
 &#x27\;s not here to enforce the law\, he&#x27\;s enforcing the dress code
 : dystopian or bust. Tank Girl&#x27\;s already at the bar starting fights 
 and finishing drinks. Neo is somewhere in the crowd\, dodging bullets and 
 jumping through synth lines. Somewhere in the fog\, a lone Replicant is qu
 estioning its own existence to a thumping beat. Mad Max stragglers are rol
 ling in from the wasteland\, chrome and leather shining under the strobes.
  And is that Furiosa headbanging in front row? yes... yes it is. The air i
 s toxic the nuclear rods are pulsing and the only cure for this meltdown i
 s more distortion! This is the end of the world as you know it and you&#x2
 7\;re going to stomp through the wreckage. PRIZE FOR BEST DYSTOPIAN COSTUM
 E. Come as your favourite fallen character: wasteland warlord\, rogue AI\,
  cybernetic insurgent\, virus containment doctor or whatever freak crawled
  out of the rubble. The apocalypse is near. Will you survive?? Featuring 
