 t with a fun sip-and-paint session/class! 🍸🎨 Sip\, Stir &amp\; Creat
 e: A Sapphic Cocktail Crafting + Sip &amp\; Paint! Come sip\, stir\, paint
 \, and connect at a cozy\, queer-centered evening made for sapphics and qu
 eer folks! Learn how to craft delicious cocktails with a hands-on cocktail
 -making experience\, then let your creativity flow during a guided sip &am
 p\; paint session. No bartending or painting experience necessary — just
  bring yourself and your creative spirit. Don&#x27\;t miss out on this opp
 ortunity to immerse yourself in the world of House Of Lambda and Let&#x27\
 ;s Get Tipsy !!! Expect good drinks\, colourful canvases\, playful energy\
 , giveaways and plenty of opportunities to meet new people in a welcoming\
 , inclusive space. Whether you’re coming with your partner\, your bestie
 s\, or flying solo\, you’re invited. Things To Consider! 🚨🚨🚨 Th
 is event is for women\, non-binary\, two-spirited\, trans babes only.🚫N
 o cis-men are permitted entry! 🎟️There will be no tickets available a
 t the door. We do recommend getting tickets online to ensure your spot\, d
